# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# MARKDOWN FILES — Keep only essential project documentation
#   Allowed: README.md, ARCHITECTURE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
#             CHANGELOG.md, SECURITY.md  (whitelisted below)
#   Blocked:  Every other .md — status logs, fix notes, guides,
#             implementation notes, conversation logs, etc.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Block ALL .md files everywhere by default ...
**/*.md

# ... then whitelist the handful that SHOULD be in the repo
!README.md
!ARCHITECTURE.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!SECURITY.md
!docs/**/*.md
!backend/README.md
!frontend/README.md
!e2e-tests/README.md

